{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-33","kind":"proposition","title":"连接两条相等平行线段所得线段仍相等平行","englishTitle":"The straight lines joining equal and parallel straight lines (at the extremities which are) in the same directions (respectively) are themselves also equal and parallel.","book":1,"number":33,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.33","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.33/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":33,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-33@raw-4b3be6affa9c2100","contentId":"euclid-1-33","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4b3be6affa9c210098caf20633a17cc9fbd19681127360c09d7fea61b8eaf555","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-33.statement","euclid-1-33.construction.1","euclid-1-33.construction.2","euclid-1-33.proof.1","euclid-1-33.proof.2","euclid-1-33.proof.3","euclid-1-33.proof.4","euclid-1-33.proof.5","euclid-1-33.conclusion","euclid-1-33.historical.1","euclid-1-33.historical.2","euclid-1-33.historical.3","euclid-1-33.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-33.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-33","revisionId":"euclid-1-33@raw-4b3be6affa9c2100","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"acc2c0fd4756a71582be07058261208fa8430aa880b79b21184bf8d83f3f7e0e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"The straight lines joining equal and parallel straight lines (at the extremities which are) in the same directions (respectively) are themselves also equal and parallel."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在同一方向(分别),平行和平行的直线(在极端),它们本身也是平等和平行的。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两平行相等线之界有两线联之其两线亦平行亦相等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两条平行且相等的线之间的边界由两条线连接，这两条线也平行且相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-33.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-33","revisionId":"euclid-1-33@raw-4b3be6affa9c2100","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9c6a74146dee15df726e600a1b28b16f0267c2926907c1d4273a6d6881b8c558","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB, CD be equal and parallel, and let the straight lines AC, BD join them (at the extremities which are) in the same directions (respectively); I say that AC, BD are also equal and parallel."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB,CD是平等和平行的,让AC,BD直线(在极端)以同样的方向(分别)连接它们;我说AC,BD也平等和平行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-33.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-1-33","revisionId":"euclid-1-33@raw-4b3be6affa9c2100","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1eb6225a9110fd53fb93d27cc46d99fa3bf27b8532be0d5896eed939b8d56ff9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let BC be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BC合二为一"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-33.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-33","revisionId":"euclid-1-33@raw-4b3be6affa9c2100","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a7cbc59742dbd2478e08e84bf5cae14baf13201a703618cdaf476b2a127a6979","citations":["euclid-1-29"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since AB is parallel to CD, and BC has fallen upon them, the alternate angles ABC, BCD are equal to one another. [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB和CD平行,BC已经落到它们身上,内错角 ABC,BCD等同。 [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-33.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-33","revisionId":"euclid-1-33@raw-4b3be6affa9c2100","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a397c0b68ca592f80d80fea99971da5317d444547d3a85a46b2c51d3f9da45c5","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AB is equal to CD, and BC is common, the two sides AB, BC are equal to the two sides DC, CB; and the angle ABC is equal to the angle BCD; therefore the base AC is equal to the base BD, and the griangle ABC is equal to the triangle DCB, and the remaining angles will be equal to the remaining angles respectively, namely those which the equal sides subtend; [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)] therefore the angle ACB is equal to the angle CBD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于AB等于CD,BC是常见的,双方AB,BC等于双方DC,CB;ABC的角等于BCD角;因此,底边,AC等于底边,BD角,ABC角等于三角形DCB,其余的角将分别等于其余的角,即平等方所向下角;因此,ACB的角等于CBD角。 [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-33.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-33","revisionId":"euclid-1-33@raw-4b3be6affa9c2100","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"91e5df10c7ba0d99d72356d694e355bf898b0ec6e6abc410c28baa225ebfe799","citations":["euclid-1-27"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the straight line BC falling on the two straight lines AC, BD has made the alternate angles equal to one another, AC is parallel to BD. [[I. 27](/principles/euclid-1-27)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于BC线两条直线相交,AC线和BD线相互相交,内错角线相互对等,AC线与BD线平行。 [[I. 27](/principles/euclid-1-27)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-33.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-33","revisionId":"euclid-1-33@raw-4b3be6affa9c2100","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bcf90a93c44bf175a4cfe1927f2378a994a18f5f6445ee65525eb34cb0cd0c5a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it was also proved equal to it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"也证明它与它相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-33.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-1-33","revisionId":"euclid-1-33@raw-4b3be6affa9c2100","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-33.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-33","revisionId":"euclid-1-33@raw-4b3be6affa9c2100","order":8,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a767bacf26447ac75c1864eb85eb90c16406ee2f0184be6b8ee076c3e1a38d5c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-33.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-33","revisionId":"euclid-1-33@raw-4b3be6affa9c2100","order":9,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f949c49ebc18fc4825588a55364f42ff2e1b8e4e0914dd34baf6d38d2188b992","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两平行相等线之界有两线联之其两线亦平行亦相等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两条平行且相等的线之间的边界由两条线连接，这两条线也平行且相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-33.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-33","revisionId":"euclid-1-33@raw-4b3be6affa9c2100","order":10,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"598d351128b6760b1aeeffc9a188da1c61eab5bb22129713764d81777ba56e5f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"解曰：甲乙丙丁两平行相等线有甲丙乙丁两线联之题言甲丙乙丁亦平行相等线"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"说明如下：甲乙丙丁 两条平行且相等的直线有 甲丙乙丁 两条直线相连。命题说明：甲丙乙丁 也与这条相等的平行直线平行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-33.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-1-33","revisionId":"euclid-1-33@raw-4b3be6affa9c2100","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7342123c9a161313c8028734e1a1497f3d8ca8e63c08b0cd44fe713ee80c7b18","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：试作甲丁对角线为甲乙丙丁之交加线即乙甲丁丙丁甲相对两内角等〈本篇卄九〉又甲丁线上下两角形之甲乙丙丁两边既等甲丁同边则对乙甲丁角之乙丁线与对丙丁甲角之甲丙线亦等〈本篇卄九〉而乙丁甲与丙甲丁两角亦等也〈本篇四〉此两角者甲丙乙丁之内相对角也两角既等则甲丙乙丁两线必平行〈本篇廿七〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：实验上，甲丁 的对角线是 甲乙丙丁 的加线，意味着 乙甲丁丙丁甲 的两个内角相等。〈本篇卄九〉 和 甲丁 是 甲丁 两边相等的两个三角形。如果 甲丁 在同一侧，那么 乙甲丁 处的 乙丁 直线和 丙丁甲 角处的 甲丙 直线也相等。〈本篇卄九〉 和 乙丁甲 以及 丙甲丁 也相等。〈本篇四〉 这两个角是 甲丙乙丁 内的对顶角。由于两个角相等，那么两条直线 甲丙乙丁 必须平行。〈本篇廿七〉"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-33.source","contentId":"euclid-1-33","revisionId":"euclid-1-33@raw-4b3be6affa9c2100","order":12,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a448d95b0d35e068d6d5ddff86f32d45e712b9e00ba2ed79d971810a500040e1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.33/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.33\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-1-33:euclid-1-29:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-33","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-33.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-29","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.33","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.33/","sourceLabel":"I. 29"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1-33:euclid-1-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-33","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-33.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-4","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.33","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.33/","sourceLabel":"I. 4"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1-33:euclid-1-27:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-33","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-33.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-27","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.33","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.33/","sourceLabel":"I. 27"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge